      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Fast money is running beside your normal career and can still blow back into work, health, and relationships.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 64,
          "startingLine": 5824
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Attention-based work is opening a second career lane, but the audience and burnout numbers matter as much as income.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 178,
          "startingLine": 5824
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Regional policy, housing strain, and budget pressure all decide whether a decent income actually feels livable.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 6063
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Family pressure is no longer abstract. Health, money, and relationship alignment are all in the same conversation now.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 48,
          "startingLine": 6291
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Family planning stays quiet until it doesn’t. This bucket keeps the hidden load visible before it blindsides the year.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 171,
          "startingLine": 6291
        }
      },
